        "chr_0034_typhoea_NormalSkill": {
            "Icon": "skillicon/icon_skill_typhoea_01",
            "Element": "Natural",
            "Name": "Piercing Arrows of the Woods",
            "Desc": "Typhoeus leaps into the air and enters a short <@ba.key>Hovering</> state, during which she can unleash 5 Aerial Basic Attacks (ABATK). Each ABATK can shoot arrows at up to 2 targets and deal <@ba.natur>Nature DMG</>.\nWhenever an ABATK hits an enemy with <#ba.naturalinflict>Nature Infliction</>, it consumes 1 stack of <#ba.naturalinflict>Nature Infliction</>, grants Typhoeus 1 <#ba.arrowenergy>Sign</>, and gives additional Ultimate Energy.\nIf Typhoeus has <#ba.arrownum>Hunting Arrow(s)</>, she consumes 1 <#ba.arrownum>Hunting Arrow</> and converts the ABATK into a <@ba.key>Power Shot</>.\n<@ba.key>Power Shot</>: After hitting an enemy, Power Shot forcibly applies 1 instance of <#ba.naturalburst>Nature Burst</>; if the target's <#ba.naturalinflict>Nature Infliction</> is consumed, then the DMG dealt by this <#ba.naturalburst>Nature Burst</> will be increased.\n<@ba.info>If Typhoeus is the controlled operator, her 5th ABATK is regarded as a Final Strike and a Power Shot, and does not consume Hunting Arrows.</>",
